          "kind": "user",
          "reference": "user-confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "status": "verified",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-23T05:36:03Z",
      "value": "Service process entrypoints are services/gateway/main.go, services/identity/main.go, services/knowledge/main.go, services/attachment/main.go, and services/collaboration/src/main.rs. Service main files only create and execute application commands; Go spec files only declare application specifications. Supporting executable entrypoints include scripts/idlguard, collaboration Rust code generation, and tools/authkeys, tools/configctl, and tools/interop. Deployment definitions live under deploy and docker."
    },
    {
      "id": "environment.setup",
      "revision": 2,
      "section": "environment",
      "sources": [
