        }
      ],
      "status": "verified",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-08T01:14:27Z",
      "value": "Go module plus a Rust workspace under services/collaboration. Use repository-pinned generators (Kitex 0.16.2, hz 0.9.7 via hz update only, thriftgo 0.4.5) and rustc 1.97.1 from rust-toolchain.toml. The collaboration interop fixture requires Node.js >= 24.18.1 and npm ci. Inject all non-public configuration through environment variables or deployment-platform secret management; never store secret values in repository configuration."
    },
